    "updated_at": "2022-06-24T02:49:25Z",
    "body": "I think there are two separate issues here: config imports, and the distribution of presets. Personally I am interested in config imports for exactly the reason given as an example in the initial comment, to be able to have local configuration in addition to shared configuration, which is especially useful for work-specific config. So I would suggest getting imports working first and then discussing presets in a separate issue. I may even have a look at imports myself if I can find the time and it's something that would be acceptable in principle.",
