    "body": "+1 for this. I was a bit dismayed when I realised that applying a preset simply overwrote the existing configuration - perhaps there should be a note warning about that on the page?\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, I'm curious if anyone else has found any ways of managing multiple presets.\r\nThe nearest to a workaround I have found so far is using https://github.com/PasaOpasen/toml-union to combine two or more presets into a single .toml file.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, there seems to be a bit of a bug with the symbols: \"  \" is converted to \"\\ue33d  \", for example. Hopefully it's an easy fix.",
