    "body": "I'm currently using [mesosphere's toml-merge](https://github.com/mesosphere/toml-merge) for this:\r\n\r\n~~~bash\r\ndocker run --rm -v \"/path/to/conf-files:/conf:ro\" -w /conf ghcr.io/mesosphere/toml-merge:v0.2.0 -p '*.toml' '10-main.toml'\r\n~~~\r\n\r\nFull example [here](https://gist.github.com/tribut/1563beef44dbae01c77bf0b34a151f96).",
